+        # NIX PATCH (security): Telegram user-ID allow-list, checked BEFORE every other handler
+        # (handler group -1) for all updates: commands, callbacks, everything. An update from
+        # anyone not in settings.searcharr_allowed_user_ids is dropped silently, so the shared
+        # password alone is not enough. Fails closed: missing/empty list allows nobody.
